{
    "title": "Stitching Into Spring: Florals, Lace, and Light Layers",
    "processed_content": "<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"12px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"font-size:12px\">\n    <!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":28} \/-->\n    <!-- wp:image {\"id\":1584961354868,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"width\":400} -->\n    <figure class=\"wp-block-image\" style=\"width:400px\"><img src=\"https:\/\/stratus.campaign-image.com\/images\/777193000034987004_zc_v1_1737565165685_mk_logo_skane_small_sage.png\" alt=\"Mother Knitter\" width=\"400\"\/><\/figure>\n    <!-- \/wp:image -->\n    <!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":52} \/-->\n    <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n    <p><\/p>\n    <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n    <!-- wp:columns -->\n    <div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n        <!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"360px\"} -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:360px\">\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>Hi $[UD:FIRST_NAME||]$!<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>The first day of spring calls for something special\u2014maybe a fresh bouquet, maybe a new project (or both). After months of knitting things to stay warm, it feels good to shift gears and start something lighter, brighter, and full of life.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>This season is all about color, texture, and a little extra joy in every stitch.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n        <\/div>\n        <!-- \/wp:column -->\n        <!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"240px\"} -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:240px\">\n            <!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"width\":330} -->\n            <figure class=\"wp-block-image\" style=\"width:330px\"><img src=\"https:\/\/stratus.campaign-image.com\/images\/777193000034987004_zc_v1_1742488070260_medium.webp_jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"330\"\/><\/figure>\n            <!-- \/wp:image -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>\u00a9 DUCATHI<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>We\u2019ve rounded up a few patterns that are perfect for the changing season\u2014floral socks, a decorative colorwork cushion, and a gorgeous yoke sweater with folky flower details. Plus, we\u2019ve paired each with the perfect yarn to make them shine.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>So if you\u2019re looking for a sign to cast on something inspired by spring, this is it!<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n        <\/div>\n        <!-- \/wp:column -->\n    <\/div>\n    <!-- \/wp:columns -->\n    <!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"width\":240} -->\n    <figure class=\"wp-block-image\" style=\"width:240px\"><img src=\"https:\/\/stratus.campaign-image.com\/images\/777193000034987004_zc_v1_1742488907802_image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\"\/><\/figure>\n    <!-- \/wp:image -->\n    <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n    <p>\u00a9 Lauren Espy<\/p>\n    <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n    <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n    <p>Saturdays, March 22 &amp; 29 | 10\u201311:30 AM<\/p>\n    <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n    <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n    <p>Get ready to stitch up something adorable! \ud83e\uddf6\u2728 In this two-session class, you\u2019ll learn the basics of amigurumi while making the cutest chubby bunny.<\/p>\n    <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n    <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n    <p>From working in the round to shaping and seaming, this class will set you up for all kinds of plushie projects.<\/p>\n    <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n    <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n    <p>Spots are limited\u2014<a href=\"https:\/\/motherknitter.com\/event\/amigurumi-plushie\/2025-03-22\/\" target=\"_blank\">sign up now<\/a> and bring this squishy little bunny to life! \ud83e\uddf6\u2728<\/p>\n    <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n    <!-- wp:separator {\"backgroundColor\":\"#376856\",\"height\":10} -->\n    <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#376856;height:10px\"\/>\n    <!-- \/wp:separator -->\n    <!-- wp:columns -->\n    <div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n        <!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"300px\"} -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:300px\">\n            <!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"width\":270} -->\n            <figure class=\"wp-block-image\" style=\"width:270px\"><img src=\"https:\/\/stratus.campaign-image.com\/images\/777193000034987004_zc_v1_1742488560225_aed159ef-db00-4217-b146-ad4ceac91fc4.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\"\/><\/figure>\n            <!-- \/wp:image -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>\u00a9 DUCATHI<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>Spring knitting doesn\u2019t have to mean giving up cozy socks.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>The Offspring Socks by DUCATHI bring a fresh twist to colorwork socks, with delicate floral motifs that make every stitch feel like the first bloom of the season.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>The pattern includes two different floral charts\u2014one with a classic tulip design and another with a four-petaled flower\u2014so you can mix, match, or knit a pair of each.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>With the floral pattern worked on the leg and simple stockinette for the foot, these socks are as practical as they are beautiful.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>That means all the eye-catching detail peeks out above your shoes, while the part inside stays smooth and comfortable.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n        <\/div>\n        <!-- \/wp:column -->\n        <!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"300px\"} -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:300px\">\n            <!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"width\":270} -->\n            <figure class=\"wp-block-image\" style=\"width:270px\"><img src=\"https:\/\/stratus.campaign-image.com\/images\/777193000034987004_zc_v1_1742488560225_aed159ef-db00-4217-b146-ad4ceac91fc4.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\"\/><\/figure>\n            <!-- \/wp:image -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>\u00a9 DUCATHI<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>Spring knitting doesn\u2019t have to mean giving up cozy socks.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>The Offspring Socks by DUCATHI bring a fresh twist to colorwork socks, with delicate floral motifs that make every stitch feel like the first bloom of the season.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>The pattern includes two different floral charts\u2014one with a classic tulip design and another with a four-petaled flower\u2014so you can mix, match, or knit a pair of each.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>With the floral pattern worked on the leg and simple stockinette for the foot, these socks are as practical as they are beautiful.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n            <!-- wp:paragraph -->\n            <p>That means all the eye-catching detail peeks out above your shoes, while the part inside stays smooth and comfortable.<\/p>\n            <!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n        <\/div>\n        <!-- \/wp:column -->\n    <\/div>\n    <!-- \/wp:columns -->\n    <!-- wp:separator {\"backgroundColor\":\"#376856\",\"height\":28} -->\n    <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#376856;height:28px\"\/>\n    <!-- \/wp:separator -->\n    <!-- wp:divider {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#376856\"}}} -->\n    <hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#376856\"\/>\n    <!-- \/wp:divider -->\n<\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->",
